      "Do not use thin one-pixel lines for important shapes or outlines.",
      "Do not over-optimize before checking whether the GIF already meets Slack limits."
    ],
    "faq": [
      {
        "question": "Can this create Slack emoji GIFs?",
        "answer": "Yes. It focuses on 128 by 128 animated GIFs and includes validation for Slack emoji readiness."
      },
      {
        "question": "Can it create larger message GIFs?",
        "answer": "Yes. It supports larger frame sizes, including 480 by 480 message GIFs."
      },
      {
        "question": "Does it include ready-made graphics?",
        "answer": "No. It provides drawing utilities and guidance, but users create graphics with Pillow primitives or uploaded images."
      },
      {
        "question": "What dependencies are required?",
        "answer": "The skill expects Pillow, imageio, imageio-ffmpeg, and NumPy in the local Python environment."
      },
      {
        "question": "Can it reduce GIF file size?",
        "answer": "Yes. It can reduce colors, resize for emoji, remove duplicate frames, and lower frame counts."
